{'symbol': 'EL', 'date': '2022-11-02 06:30:00', 'title': 'THE ESTÉE LAUDER COMPANIES INC. INCREASES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND 10% TO $.66 PER SHARE', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE ESTÉE LAUDER COMPANIES INC. (NYSE: EL) ANNOUNCED TODAY A 10% INCREASE IN THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON THE COMPANY'S CLASS A AND CLASS B COMMON STOCK TO $.66 PER SHARE, UP FROM THE PREVIOUS QUARTERLY RATE OF $.60 PER SHARE."}